    "body": "Note for the author and the next reviewer (M5): the merge of main into this draft (6e77c18b) resolved `commands/tool.rs` by moving this PR's `catalog_gate` into main's new `ChangeTool::judged(..)`. So **every** path through `judged`, including `ReshapeTool`, now runs the catalog gate, which wasn't true before. That's likely right (one gate for every tool edit), but it's a behaviour change, and the full review should confirm it when this is flagged ready. A one-line follow-up adds main's `catalog` field to the `recorded_post_streams.rs` Tool literal.",
