    "body": "Merged main into the branch (head 24adc070).\n\n- Conflict: `crates/ui/src/egui_app/pages.rs` only, both sides added lines in the tool page; kept both (the `catalog_rows` call and main's `!torch && !electrode` rpm guard). Everything else auto-merged.\n- Literal fixes (default `ToolCatalog` added): `crates/app/tests/hole_wall_flats.rs`, `crates/app/tests/thread_mill_rim.rs`, and `crates/tools/src/electrode.rs` (a `Tool` literal in main's electrode code, also E0063). All in the merge commit.\n- `git diff origin/main --stat` lists only the PR's own files plus those three.\n- clippy `-p camcraft-tools -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui -p camcraft-motion --all-targets -D warnings`: clean. Tests `tool_catalog_fields`, `hole_wall_flats`, `thread_mill_rim`, `tool_library`, `commands_undo`: all pass.\n- PR body keyword changed to `Refs #898`.\n\nReady for a re-check.\n",
