    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 24adc070e500cdabaf262bc31f8c819db009c5a7 -->\nDelta review of the merge of main (24adc070) on top of the reviewed head 530cb8c7. Ready for the maintainer to merge.\n\nChecked from `git show --remerge-diff 24adc070`:\n- `pages.rs` conflict: keep-both is correct. `catalog_rows(...)` call kept and main's `!torch && !electrode` rpm guard kept; nothing from main dropped.\n- Default `ToolCatalog` added to the `Tool` literals in `hole_wall_flats.rs`, `thread_mill_rim.rs` and `electrode.rs`. The electrode one states no catalog facts (default), so a sinker electrode behaves as before.\n- `git diff origin/main --stat`: 25 files, only the PR's files plus those three; no build.rs, .github, scripts or Cargo.toml change.\n- Body now says `Refs #898`.\n\nLocal results (merged with main, this head):\n- clippy `-p camcraft-tools -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -D warnings`: clean\n- app `tool_catalog_fields` 4, `hole_wall_flats` 11, `thread_mill_rim` 7: all pass\n- `camcraft-tools --lib`: 71 passed\n\nNo requested changes. A maintainer will approve and merge by hand.\n",
